            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-29T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-30T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-28T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-29T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Light winds becoming easterly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day then becoming light in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 9 with daytime temperatures reaching the low 20s.</text>
